WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,754
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,328 --> 00:00:03,815
A muddy blob is splashing the lemonade stand!

3
00:00:04,388 --> 00:00:07,031
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:07,605 --> 00:00:09,168
This is Episode 46.

5
00:00:09,742 --> 00:00:12,175
There is mud on the lemons and mud on the cups.

6
00:00:12,749 --> 00:00:13,575
Maya needs help.

7
00:00:14,775 --> 00:00:17,843
Here comes the sieve gate, with a little wall around the stand.

8
00:00:18,417 --> 00:00:21,418
The gate has one job: it checks everyone who knocks.

9
00:00:21,992 --> 00:00:23,871
Three little friends float up to the gate.

10
00:00:24,445 --> 00:00:26,427
The gate looks, and swings open.

11
00:00:27,001 --> 00:00:28,141
Come in, friends!

12
00:00:28,715 --> 00:00:30,472
Now the blob charges at the gate.

13
00:00:31,046 --> 00:00:32,836
The gate looks, and shuts tight.

14
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:33,857
Bounce!

15
00:00:34,431 --> 00:00:34,843
Splat!

16
00:00:35,416 --> 00:00:36,254
Nothing gets in.

17
00:00:37,454 --> 00:00:39,509
The blob puts on a hat and tries again.

18
00:00:40,082 --> 00:00:40,579
Sneaky!

19
00:00:41,153 --> 00:00:42,262
The gate is not fooled.

20
00:00:42,835 --> 00:00:43,467
Still shut.

21
00:00:44,041 --> 00:00:44,764
Friends get in.

22
00:00:45,338 --> 00:00:47,479
Mud stays out, every single time.

23
00:00:48,052 --> 00:00:49,080
That is the sieve gate.

24
00:00:49,654 --> 00:00:51,742
It checks who is knocking before they get in.

25
00:00:52,316 --> 00:00:53,276
Now you know WAF!

26
00:00:53,850 --> 00:00:55,782
Check out the Cloud Town book series.

27
00:00:56,356 --> 00:00:57,264
Link in the bio.

28
00:00:57,838 --> 00:00:58,800
See you next time!

